{
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": [
    "What each kind of shop is (read by com.skycraft.economy.ShopTrades, linted by tools/qa/data_checks.py and BarterSelfTest).",
    "anchors: the settlement anchor type (lowercase AnchorType id) that stands behind a counter -> the shop types of that building.",
    "  A building's shop is the union of its anchors' types; every merchant working in it shares ONE stock and ONE gold pool.",
    "jobs: an NPC's job id (housing job or society role id) -> which shop types it works and which item categories it may",
    "  sell from the shared stock ('sells'; absent = the whole stock). A filter over the shared stock, never a second stock.",
    "trades: per shop type: min_rows (a level 1 shop carries at least this many kinds), allow (item categories it may stock;",
    "  absent = anything), qty_scale (multiplier on the bulk quantity brackets below).",
    "quantity: bulk goods by gold value; a stack of cheap goods is bigger than a stack of expensive ones.",
    "goods_by_province: goods a shop only stocks in these provinces (gear keys): mead is a northern drink, alto wine a",
    "  southern one. An item not listed is sold everywhere. Applies to every shop's tagged goods and to an inn's table."
  ],
